      "originalText": "Four sequential stages, not eight: 30 scoring calls collapse into ONE burst, and creatives + config overlap at the end.\nThe only irreducible chain is score \u2192 shortlist \u2192 choose audience \u2192 write. The model judges; code does the arithmetic.",
